<!--
  A pin with a send arrow. Paths taken verbatim from the Figma SVG export, so
  this is the same artwork as the App Store icon rather than a redrawing.

  Viewport is 1024 to match that export. The adaptive-icon safe zone is the
  centre 66%, i.e. 170..853 here; the artwork spans roughly 273..783 including
  stroke width, so it survives any mask a launcher applies without scaling.
-->
